  <details class="signal-explanation"><summary>One idea across the stack: predictable interfaces <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="signal-notes"><p id="signal-sensor"><strong>Sensor.</strong> Know what arrived and what can go wrong.</p><p id="signal-firmware"><strong>Firmware.</strong> Validate inputs and respect timing.</p><p id="signal-api"><strong>API.</strong> Define what crosses the boundary.</p><p id="signal-interface"><strong>Interface.</strong> Show the state a person can act on.</p></div></details>
</div>
